{"root":"cinta","ipa":"/tʃinta/","core":"指对某人或某物深沉的爱、喜爱、热爱或依恋，涵盖浪漫爱情、亲情、友情以及对事物的热忱。","pos":["名词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tʃinta/","zh":"爱，爱情，热爱","phrases":[{"t":"cinta sejati","zh":"真爱"},{"t":"jatuh cinta","zh":"坠入爱河"},{"t":"cinta tanah air","zh":"爱国"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia jatuh cinta pada pandangan pertama.","zh":"他一见钟情。"},{"t":"Ibu memberikan cinta yang tulus kepada anaknya.","zh":"母亲给予孩子真挚的爱。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"cinta","ipa":"/tʃinta/","zh":"爱","phrase":{"t":"cinta monyet","zh":"青涩的初恋"},"example":{"t":"Cinta itu buta.","zh":"爱情是盲目的。"}},{"w":"mencintai","ipa":"/mənʃintai/","zh":"爱，热爱（及物动词）","phrase":{"t":"mencintai sesama","zh":"爱邻人"},"example":{"t":"Kita harus mencintai lingkungan kita.","zh":"我们必须热爱我们的环境。"}},{"w":"tercinta","ipa":"/tərʃinta/","zh":"最爱的，心爱的","phrase":{"t":"keluarga tercinta","zh":"心爱的家人"},"example":{"t":"Ini adalah surat untuk orang tercinta.","zh":"这是一封给心爱之人的信。"}},{"w":"percintaan","ipa":"/pərʃintaan/","zh":"恋爱关系，爱情生活","phrase":{"t":"kisah percintaan","zh":"爱情故事"},"example":{"t":"Percintaan mereka sangat romantis.","zh":"他们的恋爱关系非常浪漫。"}},{"w":"pencinta","ipa":"/pənʃinta/","zh":"爱好者，爱人者","phrase":{"t":"pencinta alam","zh":"自然爱好者"},"example":{"t":"Dia adalah pencinta buku sejati.","zh":"他是一位真正的书籍爱好者。"}}],"derSlugs":["cinta","mencintai","tercinta","percintaan","pencinta"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:22:36.599Z","src":"base"}